.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:904:### 4.4 Positional lexical frames, the free environment and `E`\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:972:### 4.5 What a layout never does\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:983:## 5. The safepoint harness\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:985:### 5.1 What it proves\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:995:### 5.2 The matrix\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1146:### 5.3 Lanes\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1189:### 5.4 Laws\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1209:### 5.5 Re-emission for equality (replacing \"stream-blinding\")\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1287:### 5.6 Static checks the harness runs once per corpus segment\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1322:## 6. Code and task context in the carrier\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1324:### 6.1 Code\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1351:### 6.2 Rows, not datoms\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1356:### 6.3 The free environment: carrier, source, ownership\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1444:the shared free environment; refuse, do not convert (R3; §11 6c Q3).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1448:## 7. Lift and lower\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1450:### 7.1 Lift\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1568:### 7.2 Lower\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1675:## 8. Slices, gates, entry conditions\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1681:### 8.1 Slice 6a: the frame validator and the row codec (independent)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md:1819:### 8.2 Slice 6b: full task transport and the harness on the reference lane\ndocs/design/yin.vm.